S06_A",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_IN",
          "camera": "Establishing wide / travelling camera",
          "action": "A match loops above stranded spectators beneath the stands.",
          "performance_note": "Establish the travel axis and one recognisable damaged landmark. Preserve separate Real and Chibi visual scales.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS06_B",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_IN",
          "camera": "Medium two-shot / partner eyeline",
          "action": "Ali follows distress through false celebration; companions propose different approaches.",
          "performance_note": "Use actual chosen companions; frame the tall human and small Chibi at a shared eyeline without changing their anatomy.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS06_C",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_IN",
          "camera": "Emotional close-up / held reaction",
          "action": "Ali: Follow the voices.",
          "performance_note": "Ali: concern to relief; companions: cooperation; allow a silent listening beat before the gameplay handoff.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS06_D",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_BRIDGE",
          "camera": "Action wide / readable objective geography",
          "action": "Break the loop, escort spectators through Lanternfield and orchard, reconnect posts and launcher.",
          "performance_note": "Continuous film: animate the successful main quest. Game: replace this shot with player control; do not award completion for watching it.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS06_E",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_OUT",
          "camera": "Matched before/after landmark / reaction",
          "action": "The crowd chooses its own song; a garden transmission shows masked pink hair.",
          "performance_note": "Show the quest result only after its earned flag. Keep repair particles travelling to the recorded origin.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS06_F",
          "sequence": "MS06",
          "cut_id": "MS06_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into The Masked Rose.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. LOOPING STADIUM - DAY. A winning ball hangs above the stands. Recorded applause repeats with identical timing, but the sparse Chibi spectators beneath the structure are trying to get out."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I know that sound. Last chorus, everybody acts like they have energy left.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Is that a custom where you are from?",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Sometimes it is a job.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Those people are not getting paid enough.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "A Chibi spectator flinches at the applause cue before it happens. Ali recognizes the timing of a performance continuing after its performers want to stop."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "No. Nobody volunteered for this.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Nobody is cheering.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "The speakers are.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "They have had a very long winning streak.",
          "line_id": "MS06_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "A resident points to a trapped access gate. Ali takes their direction. The party stays below the false celebration, where the physical consequences of the loop are visible."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Free the spectators, reconnect the posts and launcher, then carry the repair path through Lanternfield and the orchard. In the film a continuous escape tracks the same relay order; in play, each gate opens only after its task. The ball drops when the final loop breaks. It lands harmlessly in an empty seat."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali instinctively puts a hand up to quiet the spectators. A resident already has a better view of the escape gate and signals another route. Rose is not here to correct him. He catches himself."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Right. You know the place. Show me.",
          "line_id": "MS06_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Follow the small person with the useful information. We have a whole system.",
          "line_id": "MS06_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali follows the resident through the underside of the stands. The correction is small but visible: he is learning not to confuse being protective with being in charge."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Real local applause rises, uneven and humanlike in feeling but voiced by Chibi residents. They choose a new rhythm together. The restored receiver catches a fragment of pink hair and a black lower-face mask."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE, RADIO",
          "text": "If anyone has this channel, stay clear of the water pulse.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Rose. I'm coming.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The receiver catches Rose. Ali bends over it as if proximity could shorten the distance. Juevy's joke dies before he says it; he gently holds the antenna steady."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE, RADIO",
          "text": "Pink marker. West of the gardens. Do not follow the water.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You cannot tell me not to follow you.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE, RADIO",
          "text": "I said the water, Ali.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "There she is.",
          "line_id": "MS06_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "He stays long enough to help the last spectator over the rail. The receiver remains close to his chest."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali does not run away mid-rescue; he checks the last spectator is safe before departing. The recovered signal points to Glitch Gardens."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "False stadium glare / shaded escape lane",
        "framing": "Below-stand rescue geography contrasts with the empty winning view.",
        "sound": "Exact repeated applause breaks into chosen uneven claps."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS06_A",
        "MS06_B",
        "MS06_C",
        "MS06_D",
        "MS06_E",
        "MS06_F"
      ],
