        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS08_F",
          "sequence": "MS08",
          "cut_id": "MS08_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: join:Seraphine. Carry the eyeline into A City Under a City.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. SANCTUARY BROOK - AFTERNOON. Seraphine strains to hold an updraft open while frightened native creatures crowd the bank. Rose lowers her body and lets one creature approach instead of grabbing it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "Please stop moving toward her.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I am trying to help.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "I know. She does not.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "One frightened fairy guards the nest. Another of the same verified species cautiously investigates Ali's loose rescue clip. Seraphine lets both behave differently; neither becomes a generic friendly pet."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Give her room.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I am already the room.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "Then sit down.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "He does. The curious individual steals the clip. The guardian stays watchful."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "They know the air is wrong.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Then we make the first step feel safe.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I'll take the bridge.",
          "line_id": "MS08_IN_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Terra ties a small marker at the safe route. Each creature follows the previous one. Show local care as practiced knowledge, without dialogue from a new human rescuer."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Restore the brook bridge, gate, pool, updraft, nest, Thorn Hollow and Moonlit Glade in the audited route order. Each restored stop carries the evacuation farther and adds a distinct sample to the homeward trace. Seraphine releases the updraft only after the last creature reaches its nest."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali reaches for the stolen clip. Rose catches his hand."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Wait.",
          "line_id": "MS08_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "That is attached to a fairly important rope.",
          "line_id": "MS08_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "Watch what he does with it.",
          "line_id": "MS08_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "The curious fairy uses the clip to worry open a stuck nesting flap. Ali has mistaken a creature's task for his own inconvenience."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "...He needed a tool.",
          "line_id": "MS08_BRIDGE_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "We could have introduced you two at the shelter.",
          "line_id": "MS08_BRIDGE_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Water settles, leaves turn naturally, and the sanctuary breathes again. A thin stream of particles nevertheless drains beyond the repaired boundary."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "The wound here is closed.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Something is still pulling.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Repairing the leak will not stop whoever opened the pipe.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Then we follow the pipe.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "You waited for her to come to you.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Took coaching.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Extensive coaching.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The curious individual leaves the clip by Ali's boot, then resumes guarding its food. No instant universal bond or capture erases its temperament."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Not even a thank-you?",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "SERAPHINE",
          "text": "He returned the clip.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Fair. Strong review.",
          "line_id": "MS08_OUT_D10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Rose notices the drain beyond the repaired pool. The lightness leaves her eyes, but she does not hurry the animals out of their recovered home."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Seraphine may volunteer; unselected allies guard the sanctuary. The trail leads below the city, away from any early culprit reveal."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Soft canopy / water bounce",
        "framing": "Creature approach leads the camera across the first safe step.",
        "sound": "Wind resumes only after the nest is safe."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS08_A",
        "MS08_B",
        "MS08_C",
        "MS08_D",
        "MS08_E",
        "MS08_F"
      ],
      "gameplay_entry": {
        "cut": "MS08_IN",
        "handoff": "settled final camera and reachable objective; use existing validated gameplay spawn",
        "spawn_override": null,
