          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS09_F",
          "sequence": "MS09",
          "cut_id": "MS09_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into The Giant Who Wanted Shelter.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "INT. OLD DISTRICT RECORD ROOM - DAY. A damaged local recording flickers: BEFORE THE CALAMITY. Giant Chibi Noki steadies a bridge with an open hand as tiny residents and native creatures cross. His black spiky armour, narrow green visor and coloured chest modules match the present guardian."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "There. Before the Calamity. Do not laugh at the hair.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Noki keeps the peace. Mostly.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Mostly?",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "He once stood in the road for a whole afternoon because a nest fell out of a tree.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The recording shows an ordinary calm task, never a battle origin or a human-faced giant. Rose pauses it on the open hand."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "That is what he was trying to do when we landed.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "He still thinks someone needs shelter.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "His helmet?",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Mine. Left edge.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Young-looking archive Juevy is an earlier recording of this same local person, not manga Juevy. He is impatient to cross the bridge. Giant Noki waits for a creature to finish below it before lifting a finger."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You were in a hurry.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Always. He would not let me make it everybody else's problem.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "He watched the ground before he moved.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D11"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Still does. Even now.",
          "line_id": "MS09_IN_D12"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Follow his remembered route through the square, shrine, tunnels, pump station and flooded vault. Each place shows evidence of the same civic role: a hand-sized support recess, a repaired walkway, a sheltered den. Recover the return-anchor signal under the city."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Under the city, a support recess proves too small for Ali's arm. Juevy climbs in. Ali keeps describing what he thinks Noki did until Juevy stops him."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "I crossed this bridge. You watched a recording.",
          "line_id": "MS09_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Right. Tell me where you need me.",
          "line_id": "MS09_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Juevy points to an unglamorous pump handle. Ali takes it without another suggestion. The return trace resolves because local memory and technical evidence agree."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "EXT. GIANT DISTRICT - DUSK. Match the recorded hand to the present one. Rift energy jerks its fingers closed against Noki's intention. Tiny residents retreat under the familiar arm."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We are not fighting the thing that broke this city.",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "We are helping someone it hurt.",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Noki's present hand twitches toward the shelter. Juevy unconsciously repeats the little wave he gave the guardian in the recording."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "He remembers you?",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "I do not know.",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Juevy does not decorate that uncertainty with a joke."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "I remember him.",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Then we start there.",
          "line_id": "MS09_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Keep the guardian's scale readable with the same bridge. Carry the recovered peacekeeping gesture into the confrontation."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Dated record warmth / cold undercity",
        "framing": "Match recorded open hand to the present black armoured one.",
        "sound": "Record texture clearly separates history from present pulse."
      },
