          "camera": "Matched before/after landmark / reaction",
          "action": "Noki briefly recognises the local crew and steadies the escape path before the corruption pulls him away. Freeing him will reopen the return anchor Ali and Rose need.",
          "performance_note": "Show the quest result only after its earned flag. Keep repair particles travelling to the recorded origin.",
