        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS10_F",
          "sequence": "MS10",
          "cut_id": "MS10_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into The Current Beneath the Static.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_2_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. NOKI SHELTER DISTRICT - DUSK. Giant Noki braces the shelter as he did in the recording. A pulse drags his other arm toward the escape path. His green visor turns to the residents before the corrupted motion begins."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We can get under that arm before it drops.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "The arm is not the only thing you are measuring.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose points to Chibi residents with a shorter stride, a frightened creature, Terra carrying a failing stabilizer. Ali has unconsciously timed the crossing for his own body."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Right. Everybody's speed.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Now you are learning the place.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Wait for his hand.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Watch his hand, not the pulse.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Noki. We see them. We will get them out.",
          "line_id": "MS10_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "No heroic attack pose against the guardian. Ali plants himself where Noki can see the evacuation. Rose measures the interval between spasms. The party waits for the protective gesture."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Travel between safe zones when Noki braces the structure. Quiet the local pulse nodes and recover the signal from his support recess. Use cleansing attacks against corruption rather than finishing blows against Noki. At the final surge, he forces his open hand under the broken path so the crew can cross."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Noki's protective hand opens. Ali runs early, then stops and returns to the smallest traveller. Rose is angry at the risk, but she follows his revised timing rather than merely scolding."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You come back for the line, not after it snaps.",
          "line_id": "MS10_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I know.",
          "line_id": "MS10_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You keep saying that like knowing will catch you.",
          "line_id": "MS10_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "A pulse strikes. Noki forces his palm level despite the pain. Ali no longer treats it as terrain. He touches the armour in thanks before stepping off."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "For one breath the green visor steadies on Juevy. Noki's hand lowers gently. The distant extraction catches him again before the party can reach his chest."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "He heard us.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "And he bought us a road.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We come back with a way to free him.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Hey, big friend. We made it.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The visor settles toward him for one breath. Juevy raises his hand higher, hoping to hold the moment in place."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "There you are.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The extraction takes Noki's attention again. Juevy's raised arm remains, then slowly lowers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We are coming back.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Say it to him.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Noki. We are coming back.",
          "line_id": "MS10_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Record the signal and his pulse interval as rescue evidence. Do not award a permanent cleanse or add a small Noki to the party."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Dusk shelter / restrained warning emissive",
        "framing": "One stable wide keeps hand, residents and safe path legible.",
        "sound": "Low involuntary pulse fights a slower native heartbeat."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS10_A",
        "MS10_B",
        "MS10_C",
        "MS10_D",
        "MS10_E",
        "MS10_F"
      ],
      "gameplay_entry": {
        "cut": "MS10_IN",
        "handoff": "settled final camera and reachable objective; use existing validated gameplay spawn",
        "spawn_override": null,
