          "camera": "Medium two-shot / partner eyeline",
          "action": "Ali and Rose follow the next return-signal trace alongside the Chibi recruits. Helping them unlocks a route forward, without introducing a series of new human strangers.",
          "performance_note": "Use actual chosen companions; frame the tall human and small Chibi at a shared eyeline without changing their anatomy.",
          "start_frame": null,
