          "action": "Party change: join:Dixie. Carry the eyeline into The Captain's Last Passenger.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_3_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. DUNE CARAVAN RING - DAY. Sand Wyrm's track closes around a caravan every time its lead cart approaches the horizon. Dixie watches an outpost signal vanish in blowing sand."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "If you are here to ask whether I am dizzy, you are late.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Was going to ask which way is out.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Everybody opens with the easy question.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Dixie keeps a light rhythm with one foot because the ground's timing helps her predict the Wyrm. Her chatter is a way of staying attentive, not proof she feels no fear."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "That step. You do it before the sand moves.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Someone noticed. Lovely. Follow the feet, not the smile.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Same turn. Same dune. Same end of the day.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "It is keeping the caravan together.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "By making sure it never arrives.",
          "line_id": "MS14_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Terra marks the real outpost bearing while Rose compares the moving horizon. A resident gives Ali the cart's steering rope; he takes a place in the local plan."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Escort outpost and bazaar residents through the dune ring, expose the corruption and cleanse Wyrm. Defeat Khan and free Dixie, preserving that encounter as its own action. Recover the Dune fragments and Scarab Hook separately. The first cart crosses the previous loop line before any celebration."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "After Khan's defeat, Dixie's corruption forces her quick movement against the crew. They cleanse rather than punish her for it. Once free, she returns to the cart without waiting for praise."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You can sit down for a minute.",
          "line_id": "MS14_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "If I sit, I will notice I am shaking.",
          "line_id": "MS14_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I can take the rope.",
          "line_id": "MS14_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "...Do not pull on four. The wheel skips.",
          "line_id": "MS14_BRIDGE_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "She gives up a little control by teaching Rose the rhythm. It is more intimate than a long confession."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Its wheel leaves a new track beyond the ring. Distant supplies set off toward already restored settlements."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "I forgot the road could look different.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Where does it go?",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Today? Somewhere new.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Ooh. That tickled. Horrible experience. Would not recommend.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Your smile came back fast.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "It never left. That does not mean I was having fun.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Ali accepts the correction without an answering joke."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Glad you are out.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "DIXIE",
          "text": "Much better. Lead with that next time.",
          "line_id": "MS14_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Dixie volunteers. The camera follows the caravan far enough to prove the boundary has opened, then turns toward the tide route."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Dune haze / hard cart silhouettes",
        "framing": "Hold the wheel beyond the formerly repeating track.",
        "sound": "Wind no longer loops on the same gust."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS14_A",
        "MS14_B",
