      ],
      "opening": "A bell calls through freight lanes; the Captain holds a ship with no living passengers.",
      "objective": "Rescue workers with Pinto; cleanse Captain; recover Tide fragments and Sea Boots; restore docks, freight and Wreck Room.",
      "outcome": "The bell signals living ferries. Pinto offers to travel.",
      "map_records": [
