          "action": "Rose: That's our signal. We're getting it back.",
          "performance_note": "Ali: protective resolve; Rose: focused urgency; Quad: menace and anger; allow a silent listening beat before the gameplay handoff.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_4_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS19_D",
          "sequence": "MS19",
          "cut_id": "MS19_BRIDGE",
          "camera": "Action wide / readable objective geography",
          "action": "Confront and defeat Quad; recover the stolen crossing coordinates; restore the lodge, pass, tower, bridge, caves, wind pillar and shrine as one route to the homeward relay.",
          "performance_note": "Continuous film: animate the successful main quest. Game: replace this shot with player control; do not award completion for watching it.",
          "start_frame": null,
