          "cut_id": "MS19_OUT",
          "camera": "Matched before/after landmark / reaction",
          "action": "Quad loses control of the crossing. The crew gains a usable return-coordinate segment; he does not join HQ, the field roster or the rescue celebration.",
          "performance_note": "Show the quest result only after its earned flag. Keep repair particles travelling to the recorded origin.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_4_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS19_F",
          "sequence": "MS19",
          "cut_id": "MS19_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: antagonist:Quad. Carry the eyeline into Mirrors Are Not Replacements.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_4_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. BROKEN MOUNTAIN CROSSING - DUSK. Quad controls the far relay. The stolen homeward coordinate rotates above his position. He closes a barrier as the party approaches."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "You brought a whole audience.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We brought people who need the crossing.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "People need plenty of things.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Quad keeps his back close to the relay he controls. He is comfortable with a captive route, less comfortable when Rose walks away from his chosen conversational distance."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Those coordinates are not yours.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "They are here. I am here. You seem to understand the arrangement.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "This crossing opens when I say it does.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You took something that belongs to us.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "Then you know why you cannot leave.",
          "line_id": "MS19_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose studies the relay while Ali keeps Quad's attention. No friendly banter, handshake or recruitment invitation. Quad's role is active obstruction."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Confront and defeat Quad, recover the stolen coordinate segment, and restore the connected lodge, pass, tower, bridge, caves, wind pillar and shrine. In the film, Quad falls away from the relay before Rose retrieves the record. Do not invent his death, allegiance to Pixel or redemption."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Quad offers Ali a narrow opening that would strand the rest. Ali considers the route for one beat too long; Rose notices."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "Two visitors. One clean exit. Your local friends know how to wait.",
          "line_id": "MS19_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Open it for everyone.",
          "line_id": "MS19_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "QUAD",
          "text": "That is not the offer.",
          "line_id": "MS19_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I heard you.",
          "line_id": "MS19_BRIDGE_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali steps back beside Rose. She gives him no congratulatory speech. They both know he wanted the offer to be real."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Rose verifies the segment against both home signatures. Quad has lost the crossing; he is excluded from the departing crew and later HQ scenes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "It matches us.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "A direction?",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Part of one. Enough to stop guessing.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You looked.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "So did I.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "They verify the recovered coordinates together. Their honesty matters more than pretending temptation never happened."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We take our way. Not his.",
          "line_id": "MS19_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Quad remains defeated and outside the crew. No shared smile implies he was secretly teaching them a lesson."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "The repaired bridge points toward Mirror country. Show the coordinate secured in the scanner, not permanently burned into an unexplained new artefact."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Cold mountain pass / blocked relay",
        "framing": "Quad owns the exit axis until defeat; no friendly shared frame.",
        "sound": "Barrier impacts, then the coordinate verification tone."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS19_A",
        "MS19_B",
