          "cut_id": "MS23_BRIDGE",
          "camera": "Action wide / readable objective geography",
          "action": "Protect residents, break Vault chain and return particles to origin anchors.",
          "performance_note": "Continuous film: animate the successful main quest. Game: replace this shot with player control; do not award completion for watching it.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_5_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS23_E",
          "sequence": "MS23",
          "cut_id": "MS23_OUT",
          "camera": "Matched before/after landmark / reaction",
          "action": "A shop light steadies in the opening's framing. Protected returns make repairs last.",
          "performance_note": "Show the quest result only after its earned flag. Keep repair particles travelling to the recorded origin.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_5_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS23_F",
          "sequence": "MS23",
          "cut_id": "MS23_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into Their Own Voices.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_5_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. CHIBI MONEY MILE - DAY. Match the framing of Episode 1's street, but keep the small local architecture, residents and sky unmistakably Chibi. Ali stops at the echo."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I thought seeing something familiar would make this easier.",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Does it?",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Not in the way I wanted.",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The shopkeeper Chibi resets the same crooked sign after every pulse, more stubborn than hopeful. Ali starts to straighten it properly."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Ask.",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "...You want it level?",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The resident points out a mark showing its usual angle. Ali sets it there."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Right. Your street.",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "For a second--",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I know.",
          "line_id": "MS23_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose places their real-world image beside the current scan. The resemblance cannot substitute for an origin address. A nearby shop loses another tile as the Vault chain pulses."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Protect residents, break the Vault chain and return the displaced particles to this city's recorded anchors. Move the rescue through the audited streets instead of adding human errands. A repaired shop light now stays on through the next extraction interval."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "The chain breaks. Instead of returning immediately to the scanner, Ali waits through the next pulse interval beside the shop's repaired light. He wants proof that leaving will not undo the help."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "We can keep moving.",
          "line_id": "MS23_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "One more second.",
          "line_id": "MS23_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "She joins him. The light holds. Neither makes it into a grand speech."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Ali checks the same framing again. This street belongs to the locals who are reopening it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Not ours.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Still worth bringing back.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "The return holds when the chain cannot take it again.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "That is the shop you were looking at when we came through.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Yeah.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "I like that one. They complain if you buy nothing. They complain if you buy the last one.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Strong business model.",
          "line_id": "MS23_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Ali leaves the sign at its crooked mark and rejoins the road. Familiarity now belongs to an actual local life he knows, not a visual resemblance to home."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "The successful protected return becomes the method for the remaining chains. Leave the city's own music with its residents."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Chibi street echo / repaired shop practical",
        "framing": "Match Episode 1 composition while preserving different architecture.",
        "sound": "Local street music remains distinct from the official song."
      },
