          "cut_id": "MS24_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into Who Has Been Watching.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_5_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. STADIUM SPEAKER ROUTE - DAY. The speakers issue a command. Residents hesitate, then one answers with a rhythm of their own. Another joins."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I could get their attention.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "They already have each other's.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali lowers his raised hand. A resident starts a rhythm; the next person answers imperfectly. Nothing about it is polished for an audience."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You hate not fixing the first thing you see.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I hate standing there while somebody needs me.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Sometimes they need the space you are standing in.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "They do not need us to pick the song.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Just to turn that thing off.",
          "line_id": "MS24_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali and Rose follow the residents' evacuation signals. The camera grants the locals the first clear decision in the scene."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Break the stadium chain, protect the crowd and reconnect the Golden Dragon history archive. Depict the record as local history, not a flashback revealing Pixel or the greater evil. Six Power Cores once helped bend reality toward peace; their fragmentation made their power available to coercion."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "While the crew breaks the speakers, Terra watches the archive's six core shapes and the old peaceful settlements. Her hand moves toward a control, then stops before adjusting a neighbour's chosen route."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "What?",
          "line_id": "MS24_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Nothing. They are doing it differently.",
          "line_id": "MS24_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Wrong?",
          "line_id": "MS24_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "...Differently.",
          "line_id": "MS24_BRIDGE_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "She withdraws her hand. The action gives the coming argument about order a personal cost before Pixel is identified."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Six original shapes settle on the display. Beside them, a recorded open gate closes only when its traveller has crossed."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "A wish can change reality.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Then we ask it to fix what was stolen.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Without deciding what everyone has to become.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "If we can wish the damage away, who decides what counts as damage?",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "The missing streets. The rifts.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I know. I am asking before we hold the thing that can answer.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Not somebody's choice. Even the ones that make you want to grab the controls.",
          "line_id": "MS24_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Terra looks at the hand she withdrew. The line belongs to her own difficult practice, not an abstract moral lesson."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Establish free choice as the final wish's limit. No character wishes for obedient happiness or the erasure of painful memory."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Stadium daylight / legible archive inserts",
        "framing": "Residents choose the first response before Ali acts.",
        "sound": "Command speakers stop; the crowd sets a new rhythm."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS24_A",
        "MS24_B",
        "MS24_C",
        "MS24_D",
        "MS24_E",
        "MS24_F"
      ],
      "gameplay_entry": {
        "cut": "MS24_IN",
        "handoff": "settled final camera and reachable objective; use existing validated gameplay spawn",
        "spawn_override": null,
        "capture_party_snapshot": true
      },
      "gameplay_exit": {
        "cut": "MS24_OUT",
        "requires": "MS24_objective_complete",
