        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS26_F",
          "sequence": "MS26",
          "cut_id": "MS26_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: temporary_leave:local_support. Carry the eyeline into Two Cities, One Crossing.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_6_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. QUEEN BOWER - NIGHT. The Chibi Queen shields the bower. Realistic Rose arrives with established Chibi volunteers. Frame both characters together so the distinction is immediate and unambiguous."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "You brought volunteers.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I asked.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "You did not order them?",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Tried that with one person. Terrible results.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I am standing right here.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The Queen nearly smiles, then looks to the bower she can no longer hold alone. She gives a task away without calling it a royal command."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "Will you take the ground?",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "I can hold the light. I cannot hold the ground.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Then let us take the ground.",
          "line_id": "MS26_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The saved local support ally elects to stay with the endangered residents. No guilt prompt; this is useful work chosen in an emergency."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Break the sanctuary chain, protect Queen Bower and Edge Wish, and return the last assigned fragments to their origin anchors. Restore the local return station as part of the main route. The film follows the same safe crossing that play requires."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "A local support ally chooses to remain with the residents. Ali reaches for the party marker, then puts it back. The choice does not need his permission to matter."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We will keep a route open.",
          "line_id": "MS26_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "And you tell us when you are ready. Not when you think you ought to be.",
          "line_id": "MS26_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose has been holding herself to the standard she is now releasing for someone else. Ali notices but saves the remark; care is not always a correction spoken aloud."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The bower stabilizes. The support ally sends a ready signal after the final resident reaches safety; the party can retrieve them on the connected route."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "This anchor can carry a return now.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "Then make sure it carries yours.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Ours, and every address it was holding.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "You keep checking the gate.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Habit.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "For your home?",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "For who is missing from it.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The Queen looks at her own surviving residents. Their two different attachments share a feeling without becoming the same life."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "FAIRY QUEEN",
          "text": "Then go with the people you came for.",
          "line_id": "MS26_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Update the temporary absence flag. The Queen remains a local person with her own duty, never a replacement body for Rose."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Bower warmth / unstable ground shadow",
        "framing": "Real Rose and Chibi Queen share distinct eye lines in a wide.",
        "sound": "Safe returning air rises after the ground steadies."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS26_A",
        "MS26_B",
