          "action": "Party change: party:final_launch. Carry the eyeline into The Place Terra Held.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "INT. JUEVY JET HANGAR - DAY. Terra installs a repair coupler beside existing combat systems. The jet-to-mech design remains the source-game machine, distinct from La Catrina."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "I would like the record to show that I preferred flying before the moon tried to eat a planet.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "The record has a lot of your preferences.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Good archive practice.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Terra rechecks the coupler. Rose is already beside its backup diagram; neither treats the private planning conversation as finished after a reassuring sentence."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Show me the manual release.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Both sides.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Good. We train both sides.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "It was built to get us there.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Now it can bring something back.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Preferably all of us.",
          "line_id": "MS34_IN_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose checks the home window, then turns it off during launch preparation. They must solve the lunar threat before crossing. Terra secures her white wrap and crimson sash away from machinery."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Complete the proving ground and required upgrades. Show the jet-to-mech conversion in clear mechanical stages with no unapproved transformation parts. Test the repair coupler on displaced matter, confirming the return address survives. Save the selected launch party and assign the established unselected crew to rescue and ground support."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Ali bungles the tiny practice latch, then wants to compensate with strength. Terra covers it with her palm before he can."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "It needs the right pressure. Not your apology.",
          "line_id": "MS34_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You could have said less pressure.",
          "line_id": "MS34_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Would you have heard it?",
          "line_id": "MS34_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "He resets his grip and succeeds gently. Terra allows herself a little proud nod, then hands Rose the tool so she can do the same check. She is teaching the work instead of making herself its only solution."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The launch crew checks one another's restraints. HQ reports that the rescue route is ready."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Return channel?",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Open.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Backup crew?",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Waiting for our extremely normal landing.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I kept the cup.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "I noticed. You attached it like emergency equipment.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "It has survived quite a lot of roofs.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "When you get home, put it somewhere boring.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Rose checks Ali's restraint; Ali checks hers. Terra checks Juevy's. Juevy checks Terra's even though she starts to wave him away."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "Let me do the useful bit.",
          "line_id": "MS34_OUT_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "She holds still and lets him."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "One small shared laugh. Launch into the same direction of travel as the previous map. Do not preannounce Terra's loss or make it a punishment for the player's companion choice."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Hangar worklight / readable metal",
        "framing": "Test coupler and original jet-to-mech mechanics in separate views.",
        "sound": "Practical checks and restrained instrumental launch cue only."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS34_A",
        "MS34_B",
