          "action": "Terra holds the coupler; her choice follows care shown throughout the journey.",
          "performance_note": "Use actual chosen companions; frame the tall human and small Chibi at a shared eyeline without changing their anatomy.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS35_C",
          "sequence": "MS35",
          "cut_id": "MS35_IN",
          "camera": "Emotional close-up / held reaction",
          "action": "Terra: Keep the road open for everyone else.",
          "performance_note": "Terra: steady fear; Ali: panic, refusal, silence; allow a silent listening beat before the gameplay handoff.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS35_D",
          "sequence": "MS35",
          "cut_id": "MS35_BRIDGE",
          "camera": "Action wide / readable objective geography",
          "action": "Disable engine, redirect particles and evacuate. Her loss is authored, never punishment for party selection.",
          "performance_note": "Continuous film: animate the successful main quest. Game: replace this shot with player control; do not award completion for watching it.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS35_E",
          "sequence": "MS35",
          "cut_id": "MS35_OUT",
          "camera": "Matched before/after landmark / reaction",
          "action": "Terra's signal is lost as the breach closes. No confirmed death or instant resurrection. Pixel's Season 1 plan ends.",
          "performance_note": "Show the quest result only after its earned flag. Keep repair particles travelling to the recorded origin.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS35_F",
          "sequence": "MS35",
          "cut_id": "MS35_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: lost:Terra. Carry the eyeline into Marigolds for the Missing.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_7_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. LUNAR ENGINE APPROACH - SPACE. Dogfighting carries the jet toward a corridor that begins erasing the edge of a distant planet. On the monitor the address labels vanish before the matter does."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "That is a whole planet.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I see it.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "No. I mean... somebody is having an ordinary day down there.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The erasure corridor takes a sliver of the distant horizon. Do not cut to new realistic civilians; the idea is carried by Ali looking at a place that contains lives."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Then we keep it ordinary.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "It is not just opening a rift.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "It is deleting the destination.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "I can put the return ahead of the extraction.",
          "line_id": "MS35_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "The mech unfolds against the engine's physical scale. Give the audience one stable orientation before combat. No music lyric competes with the operational dialogue."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Disable the engine defences, protect the origin records and connect the coupler. The automatic release fails. Terra reaches the local coupler cradle, available as a required story role regardless of selected party. A rescue tether remains visible. Redirect the particles before the planet-erasure corridor completes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "The coupler transfer jams under the final surge. Terra identifies the manual cradle and explicitly checks the rescue tether with Rose. No one hides a plan to stay behind."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Local latch. I know the pressure.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Return line is on. I am taking the other end.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I have the route back.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Good. Nobody improvises a dramatic ending.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "She tries to make it light, but her fingers fumble once. Rose repeats the connector test from the hangar. Terra meets her eyes and steadies."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You do the latch. We do the way back.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "On three.",
          "line_id": "MS35_BRIDGE_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The return begins. Ali reaches the coupler cradle. Terra is still connected to the rescue tether."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "One. Two. There--the return is moving.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "We have it. Come back to the line.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You skipped three.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "TERRA",
          "text": "Learned from terrible company.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Ali reaches her. For half a breath it is almost an ordinary rescue, the three of them doing the jobs they agreed. A warning pulse races along the engine wall. The way back begins to buckle."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Terra. Hand.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Line holding. Take it--",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Terra extends her hand. A last surge shears a breach between them. The tether snaps taut, then vanishes into white interference. The redirected particles seal the planet-erasure corridor. Terra loses contact; her signal disappears. Hold Ali reaching into the empty space after there is nothing to catch."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "You were right there.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "Terra?",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Rose is still gripping the dead line. She does not have a precise answer, and she does not manufacture one."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "Keep the channel open.",
          "line_id": "MS35_OUT_D09"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "The rescue crew extracts survivors. Pixel's Season 1 erasure operation is stopped. Terra is missing with signal lost, not confirmed permanently dead; no body, instant reunion or secret cutaway proves a fate. End on the unanswered channel."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Lunar dark / immense erasure corridor",
        "framing": "Establish mech scale, then tether and empty reaching hand.",
        "sound": "No lyric; engine drop to silence when signal vanishes."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS35_A",
        "MS35_B",
        "MS35_C",
