      "realm": "CHIBI / La Catrina Eterna",
      "character_turn": "La Madre's desire to remember has trapped the living. Ali recognises the cost of refusing goodbye.",
      "dialogue": "Ali: We still have people to bring home.",
      "expression_cues": "Ali: grief to purpose; Rose: listening; Madre: release",
      "party_event": "none",
      "chapter": 8,
      "chapter_title": "Home, With a Way Back",
      "homeward_purpose": "Advance the connected route to Ali and Rose's own reality; local repairs remove a specific obstruction or recover the next fragment, signal or return coordinate.",
      "shots": [
        {
