        },
        {
          "shot_id": "MS36_F",
          "sequence": "MS36",
          "cut_id": "MS36_OUT",
          "camera": "Departure tracking / companion insert",
          "action": "Party change: none. Carry the eyeline into The Life Behind the Other Mask.",
          "performance_note": "Honour unavailable, temporarily absent and lost allies. Never invent a fixed party to fill the frame.",
          "start_frame": null,
          "end_frame_exclusive": null,
          "illustration": "illustrations/Act_8_Storyboard.png"
        }
      ],
      "script_blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN",
          "text": "EXT. HAUNT HOLLOW - MUTED DAY. The bone ship rises over the town. Ali carries the empty white wrap and crimson sash recovered with the returning equipment; Terra herself is absent. Rose walks beside him without forcing a conversation."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I can still hear the count.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I know.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I keep getting to two.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Rose starts to adjust the empty tether clip, notices she has already straightened it, and stops. She sits beside him without a scanner between them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I keep checking the latch.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We checked it.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "I know.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Knowing has not made either hand stop repeating the action. The scene allows grief to be unreasonable without calling it a puzzle to solve."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I keep waiting for the signal.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "We can keep listening.",
          "line_id": "MS36_IN_D08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "IN",
          "label": "IN_ACTION",
          "text": "Leave a held silence. A native inhabitant needs help crossing a damaged street. Ali notices and moves, still carrying the grief."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE",
          "text": "Help the inhabitants, cleanse Madre, recover Marigold Heart and Spirit Step through their actual conditions, and restore the streets. Colour returns to the place rather than summoning Terra. Maintain the distinct identities of the bone ship, La Catrina and the earlier jet-mech."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "In Haunt Hollow, native inhabitants resume a candle procession after the route is safe. Ali tries to give Terra a formal, complete memorial and cannot finish arranging the wrap. A local sets down a candle without asking for a statement about her fate."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "MADRE",
          "text": "You do not have to finish knowing to make a place.",
          "line_id": "MS36_BRIDGE_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "We did not see--",
          "line_id": "MS36_BRIDGE_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "MADRE",
          "text": "Then leave room for what you did not see.",
          "line_id": "MS36_BRIDGE_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "BRIDGE",
          "label": "BRIDGE_ACTION",
          "text": "Cleanse Madre and complete the source tasks without treating them as a transaction that can purchase Terra's return. Rose leaves the receiver beside the flowers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The crew places marigolds by a listening receiver. The empty wrap and sash occupy a seat; no glowing Terra silhouette appears."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "She would have stopped to help.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D01"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "She did.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D02"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "So do we.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D03"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "She would hate the chair.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D04"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ALI",
          "text": "I thought she would like it.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D05"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "JUEVY",
          "text": "She would say you left it in the path.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D06"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "Ali moves it an inch. The adjustment draws the first small laugh out of him, and he feels guilty for it. Rose catches that too."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "ROSE",
          "text": "You are allowed.",
          "line_id": "MS36_OUT_D07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "OUT",
          "text": "The laugh ends. The grief stays. Both can occupy the same scene."
        },
        {
          "kind": "action",
          "phase": "OUT",
          "label": "END_ACTION",
          "text": "Let the sentence resolve in action, not a promise of resurrection. The remaining homeward route continues through Dealer's encounter."
        }
      ],
      "visual_direction": {
        "palette": "Muted hollow / returning marigold colour",
        "framing": "Empty seat stays empty; no Terra silhouette in the light.",
        "sound": "Receiver stays open under real breathing and town ambience."
      },
      "baseline_shot_ids": [
        "MS36_A",
        "MS36_B",
